{
  "item": {
    "id": "55d5a86a-7ef6-4676-b3fc-d4b4fd05b23b",
    "content_type": "generic",
    "workflow_state": "staging",
    "page_title": "Events endpoint",
    "short_description": "Query and replay events that have flowed through a pipeline via the v3 REST API with improved filtering and replay operations.",
    "body": "<h1>Events endpoint {{ds:component/chip|label=v3|variant=primary}}</h1>
<p>Query and replay <a href=\"{{cms:item/6277e4fb-3e99-45b0-a7f6-aefe69c5778f}}\">events</a> that have flowed through a pipeline with enhanced filtering, better error handling, and improved pagination.</p>

<h2 id=\"list\">List events</h2>
<p><code>GET /v3/pipelines/{pipeline_id}/events</code> — cursor-paginated, filterable by <code>type</code>, <code>status</code>, and <code>occurred_at</code> range.</p>

{{ds:component/parameter-table|rows_html=<tr><td><code>type</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Filter to a single event type, e.g. <code>order.created</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Filter by event status: <code>processed</code>, <code>failed</code>, or <code>dead_lettered</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>since</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>ISO-8601 timestamp lower bound on <code>occurred_at</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>until</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>ISO-8601 timestamp upper bound on <code>occurred_at</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>cursor</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Opaque pagination cursor from a previous response's <code>next_cursor</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>limit</code></td><td>integer</td><td>No</td><td>Maximum results per page (1–100, default 20).</td></tr>}}

{{ds:component/code-block|filename=event.json|language=json|code={\n  \"id\": \"evt_8f2c1a90\",\n  \"type\": \"order.created\",\n  \"status\": \"processed\",\n  \"occurred_at\": \"2026-08-18T09:12:44Z\",\n  \"processed_at\": \"2026-08-18T09:12:45Z\",\n  \"payload\": { \"order_id\": \"ord_4471\" },\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"retry_count\": 0,\n    \"source\": \"webhook\"\n  }\n}}}

<h2 id=\"replay\">Replay a dead-lettered event</h2>
<p><code>POST /v3/events/{id}/replay</code> — re-runs an event that exhausted its retries. The response includes the new attempt ID and status. Replay operations are tracked in event history.</p>

{{ds:component/code-block|filename=replay-response.json|language=json|code={\n  \"id\": \"evt_8f2c1a90\",\n  \"status\": \"processing\",\n  \"attempt_id\": \"att_9d3e2b11\",\n  \"replayed_at\": \"2026-08-20T14:35:22Z\"\n}}}

<h2 id=\"status\">Get event status</h2>
<p><code>GET /v3/events/{id}</code> — retrieve the full history, status, and retry information for a specific event.</p>

{{ds:component/code-block|filename=event-detail.json|language=json|code={\n  \"id\": \"evt_8f2c1a90\",\n  \"type\": \"order.created\",\n  \"status\": \"processed\",\n  \"occurred_at\": \"2026-08-18T09:12:44Z\",\n  \"processed_at\": \"2026-08-18T09:12:45Z\",\n  \"payload\": { \"order_id\": \"ord_4471\" },\n  \"attempts\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"att_8f2c1a90\",\n      \"status\": \"success\",\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-18T09:12:45Z\",\n      \"duration_ms\": 142\n    }\n  ]\n}}}

{{ds:component/alert|variant=info|title=Platform events|body_html=<p>Lifecycle notifications like <code>pipeline.started</code> and <code>connector.error</code> are not returned by this endpoint — subscribe to them through the Webhooks endpoint instead.</p>}}

{{ds:component/docs-toc|items_html=<li><a href=\"#list\">List events</a></li><li><a href=\"#replay\">Replay a dead-lettered event</a></li><li><a href=\"#status\">Get event status</a></li>}}",
    "version_token": "6d912ec3-72c2-41a7-8956-5b03244df5b6",
    "created_at": "20

{
  "item": {
    "id": "bb137086-ba77-4d11-87e6-36de66c72b7d",
    "content_type": "generic",
    "workflow_state": "public",
    "page_title": "Webhooks endpoint",
    "short_description": "Subscribe to Godzilla platform lifecycle events over outbound HTTP via the v2 REST API.",
    "body": "<h1>Webhooks endpoint {{ds:component/chip|label=v2|variant=primary}}</h1>
<p>Subscribe to platform lifecycle events — such as <code>pipeline.completed</code> or <code>connector.error</code> — as outbound HTTP requests to a URL you control. This is the v2 replacement for v1's polling-only status checks; see the <a href="{{cms:item/e5867e15-c2d8-4385-8fa1-18f3b76ec362}}">Migration guide</a> if you're moving off v1.</p>

<h2 id="create">Create a webhook subscription</h2>
<p><code>POST /v2/webhooks</code></p>

{{ds:component/parameter-table|rows_html=<tr><td><code>url</code></td><td>string</td><td>Yes</td><td>HTTPS endpoint Godzilla will POST events to.</td></tr><tr><td><code>events</code></td><td>array</td><td>Yes</td><td>List of event types to subscribe to, e.g. <code>["pipeline.failed"]</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>secret</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Shared secret used to sign the <code>X-Godzilla-Signature</code> header. Auto-generated if omitted.</td></tr>}}

{{ds:component/code-block|filename=webhook-payload.json|language=json|code=&#123;
  "id": "evt_wh_2091",
  "type": "pipeline.failed",
  "occurred_at": "2026-08-18T09:14:02Z",
  "data": &#123; "pipeline_id": "pl_ingest_orders", "error": "destination_timeout" &#125;
&#125;}}

{{ds:component/alert|variant=warning|title=Verify the signature|body_html=<p>Always verify <code>X-Godzilla-Signature</code> before trusting a webhook payload. Unsigned or unverifiable requests to your endpoint should be rejected, not processed.</p>}}

<h2 id="retries">Delivery retries</h2>
<p>A webhook delivery that doesn't receive a <code>2xx</code> response is retried with exponential backoff for up to 24 hours, then marked failed. Failed deliveries are visible per-subscription and can be manually redelivered.</p>

{{ds:component/docs-toc|items_html=<li><a href="#create">Create a webhook subscription</a></li><li><a href="#retries">Delivery retries</a></li>}}",
